{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-06-22 04:00:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK SILVER PROVIDES EXPLORATION UPDATE ON TONOPAH WEST AND SILVER CLOUD PROJECTS', 'text': 'VANCOUVER, BRITISH COLUMBIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JUNE 22, 2023) - BLACKROCK SILVER CORP. (TSXV: BRC) (THE "COMPANY" OR "BLACKROCK") IS PLEASED TO UPDATE THE MARKET ON ITS TWO, 100-PERCENT CONTROLLED HIGH-GRADE SILVER-GOLD PROJECTS IN NEVADA. THE TONOPAH WEST PROJECT LOCATED WITHIN THE WALKER LANE TREND IN WEST CENTRAL NEVADA, AND THE SILVER CLOUD PROJECT LOCATED ALONG THE PROLIFIC NORTHERN NEVADA RIFT IN NORTH CENTRAL NEVADA.'}